 "@id": "fylite:app/case/evolve-east-hmode",
 "@type": "fylite:AppSession/1",
 "fylite:page": "evolve",
 "fylite:case": {
  "fylite:name": "EAST 长脉冲（欧姆＋辅助加热，含电流道与锯齿）",
  "fylite:name_en": "EAST long pulse (ohmic + auxiliary, with the current channel and sawteeth)",
  "fylite:device": "east",
  "fylite:note": "★这一档跑在**装置解出的平衡**上：EAST 是本仓唯一自带参考放电的机器，所以几何、q 与逐面度规都来自那次解，电流道才有 ⟨|∇ρ|²/R²⟩ 可用。★成分是自洽的一组：碳 1.65 % 隐含 Z<sub>eff</sub> = 1.50，与控件上的 1.5 对得上——读数里那两个数就是给你核这件事的。★耦合节律留在 0（几何冻结）：打开它每 K 步要重解一次自由边界平衡，约 0.8 s 一次，值不值得由你定。★<strong>V<sub>loop</sub> = 0.15 V 是「大致维持电流」的那个值</strong>，不是测出来的：0 V 时 0.5 s 内 q95 从 2.5 电阻性衰到 3.1，0.5 V 则驱到 1.4——0.15 V 把它按在 2.5 附近。★<strong>χ₀ = 4 m²/s 是读者的旋钮</strong>，取它是因为 4 MW 加热下它给出 T<sub>e</sub>(0) ≈ 3.2 keV、T<sub>i</sub>(0) ≈ 2.2 keV，与 EAST 这一类放电同量级。这一档<strong>不是一次经过验证的 EAST 模拟</strong>：没有台基、没有湍流闭包、杂质浓度是规定的常数——它是一个能跑通电流道、锯齿与杂质辐射的<strong>起点</strong>，用来往下调。",
  "fylite:note_en": "★This case runs on a SOLVED device equilibrium: EAST is the only machine shipped here that carries a reference discharge, so the geometry, q and the surface metric all come from that solve -- which is what gives the current channel a gm2 to use. ★The composition is self-consistent: carbon at 1.65 % implies Z_eff = 1.50, matching the control at 1.5, and the two numbers in the readings are there for you to check exactly that. ★The coupling cadence is left at 0 (frozen geometry): switching it on re-solves the free-boundary equilibrium every K steps at about 0.8 s each. ★<strong>V_loop = 0.15 V is the value that roughly holds the current</strong>, not a measurement: at 0 V the resistive decay takes q95 from 2.5 to 3.1 over 0.5 s and at 0.5 V it is driven to 1.4, while 0.15 V pins it near 2.5. ★<strong>chi0 = 4 m^2/s is the reader's knob</strong>, chosen because with 4 MW of heating it gives T_e(0) about 3.2 keV and T_i(0) about 2.2 keV, the order of this class of EAST discharge. This case is <strong>not a validated EAST simulation</strong>: no pedestal, no turbulent closure, a prescribed constant impurity concentration. It is a STARTING POINT that exercises the current channel, the sawtooth and impurity radiation, and that you then tune."
 },
